  "display_fullname": "Epic Electrical Mastery Surge of Power",
  "display_help": "When you activate this power, you transform your body into living Electricity and become extremely resistant to all damage but Psionics.  However, expending all this energy will leave you exhausted, and drained of all endurance. Unrelenting from the Presence pool can be used to prevent this crash from occurring. You must be level 41 and have Static Discharge or Shocking Bolt before selecting this power. Recharge: Very Long",
